,{"id":"d_main_14_10_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_14_10_7","text":"She has enigmatic powers beyond our comprehension.\nIt's no wonder she's attracted so much attention.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_14_10_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_14_10_8","text":"I'm glad that it all worked out, but","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_14_10_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_14_10_9","text":"do you think this is gonna be the end of it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_14_10_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_14_10_10","text":"I doubt it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_14_10_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_14_10_11","text":"There's nothing they won't do to get their hands on Marian. Today was nothing, they're capable of much worse.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_14_10_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_14_10_12","text":"Hmm... Then what are we supposed to do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_14_10_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_14_10_13","text":"We either give up, or we protect her to the end.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":nul